      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "SAM2Matting — streaming grey-background workflow\n\n1. Enter a video path visible inside the ComfyUI machine/container, then load a black/white seed mask. White = foreground.\n2. The seed mask must match mask_frame (zero-based).\n3. background_color defaults to middle grey (#808080).\n4. gpu keeps the bounded temporal state on the GPU; cpu trades VRAM for system RAM.\n5. Streaming Options contains cache, worker, encoder, FPS, quality, audio, edge-stabilization, and logging controls. It is optional; the main node has safe defaults without it.\n\nThe path loader bypasses the browser upload limit. Lossless Zstandard tracking frames are the default. Processing uses bounded queues and returns a native VIDEO without creating a full IMAGE or MASK batch."
      ],
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#34506b"
    },
